<title>HUNGARY: BORSODCHEM Q1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 1.758BLN.</title>
<headline>BORSODCHEM Q1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 1.758BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-March 1997    Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 1,941.3     vs     1,753.3</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   2,129.3     vs     2,066.0</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	 1,758.4     vs     1,693.0</p>
<p>    Group net sales		 13,557.3     vs    10,276.7</p>
<p>    Group other revenues	     488.7     vs	 326.2</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	  9,758.8     vs     6,490.1</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales	1,825.0     vs     1,901.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		 520.8     vs	 485.4</p>
<p>    Net financial income	     180.9 profit vs 325.1 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue		214.7     vs	 443.1</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	   33.8     vs	 118.0</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	   7.1 profit vs  12.4 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	   17.3     vs	   0.7</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure     10.2     vs	  13.1</p>
<p>    Taxation			     376.0     vs	 376.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Borsodchem Rt is a chemicals company. The figures</p>
<p>are consolidated, are unaudited and are calculated in</p>
<p>accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
